<article class="bl-privacy-content bl-prose"><h2>Who this website represents</h2><p>bobliftloader.com is the compact equipment business website of Xuzhou BOB-LIFT Construction Machinery Co., Ltd. Contact the company at <a href="mailto:info@boblift.com">info@boblift.com</a>.</p><?php if (bl_inquiry_form_id()): ?><h2>How the enquiry form works</h2><p>The form sends your enquiry to the BOB-LIFT team by email. Choose your equipment, add your contact details and a short description of your project, then press “Send enquiry”.</p>
